      "description": "## Vendors\n\nThis folder contains the API endpoints that support the **Vendor self-onboarding and session management** flow in the ProcureX platform. It is designed for use by external vendors who register independently and interact with the system using their own credentials.\n\n### What's included\n\n- **Self Registration** — Allows a new vendor to register themselves on the platform via `POST /api/v1/auth/vendor/register`. Vendor accounts are subject to admin approval before gaining full access.\n- **Vendor Login** — Authenticates a registered vendor and returns an access token via `POST /api/v1/auth/login`.\n- **Refresh Token** — Renews an expired access token without requiring re-login via `POST /api/v1/auth/refresh`.\n- **Logout** — Invalidates the current session and access token via `POST /api/v1/auth/logout`.\n\n### Usage\n\nStart with the **Self Registration** request to create a vendor account, then await admin approval. Once approved, use **Vendor Login** to authenticate and obtain a token for subsequent API interactions."
